<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191">To meet the needs of patients in this community and across
our great country, the American Red Cross needs to collect </span><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:red">more than</span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;
mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:191"> </span><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;
color:red">5 million</span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;
color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:191"> blood donations each
year. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><i><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;
mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:191;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold">&nbsp;</span></i></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#404040;mso-themecolor:text1;
mso-themetint:191">Community-minded organizations like yours hold blood drives
to help ensure donation opportunities are convenient for donors, support the
community blood supply and ultimately help save lives.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">Please call me at&nbsp;</span><font color="#ff0000" face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">{!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span></font><font color="#404040" face="Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;or visit us &nbsp;at&nbsp;</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="http://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-blood-drive"><span style="font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;color:#0070C0">redcrossblood.org/hosting-blood-drive</span></a></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"> </span><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">to learn more about how you can help your
community.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><img src="https://c.na74.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0151J000003WVLs&amp;oid=00Do0000000YrbP" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><span style="color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;; font-size: 11pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0.5in 0.0001pt 0.25in;"><br></p>]]></td>
